{"timestamp": 1779402577.333386, "event_type": "phase_changed", "tick": 11, "data": {"phase": "discussion"}}
{"timestamp": 1779402591.1568599, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "I found Charlie\u2019s body in Weapons and reported immediately. My route was Medbay -> Electrical -> Security -> Weapons. I saw Diana enter Electrical from Security around tick 5, then I saw Frank in Security around tick 7. I did not see Bob at all this round, and I didn\u2019t see who killed Charlie."}}
{"timestamp": 1779402612.459699, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "My route was Navigation -> Security -> Electrical -> Medbay. I saw both Bob and Charlie alive in Security around tick 3, together. Then I left toward Electrical, and I saw Alice in Electrical around tick 5, which matches her saying she saw me coming from Security. After that I went to Medbay and was there when the report happened.\n\nI didn\u2019t see Eve or Frank myself. Since Charlie ended up dead in Weapons and Bob is also dead, the key area seems like Security/Weapons after tick 3. Alice and Frank are the only names placed around Security/Weapons after I left, based on Alice\u2019s report, but I don\u2019t have a direct accusation yet."}}
{"timestamp": 1779402636.070155, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "My route was Cafeteria -> Weapons -> Security -> Storage. I can confirm crossing paths with Alice in Security around tick 7. \n\nBefore that, I was in Weapons and I actually saw Charlie alive there around tick 4 and 5. I just did my task and left him there perfectly fine, heading down to Security. Since Alice found his body in Weapons shortly after I left, the killer must have slipped in right behind me, or maybe they vented? \n\nI haven't seen Bob all game, so I have no idea where he could have died. Eve, we haven't heard from you yet and you're the only one unaccounted for \u2014 where have you been this whole round?"}}
{"timestamp": 1779402674.4079502, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "I was not in that area at all. My route was Storage to Lower Engine, and I didn\u2019t encounter anyone, so I can\u2019t vouch for anyone and nobody can vouch for me.\n\nLooking at the stories: Diana and Alice line up on Electrical around tick 5, and Alice and Frank line up in Security around tick 7. The weirdest part to me is Frank\u2019s story \u2014 he says he was in Weapons with Charlie alive around tick 4/5, then Charlie is later found dead in Weapons. That makes Frank the last person claiming to see Charlie alive in the exact room where the body was found. Also pushing suspicion onto me just because I was unseen feels convenient, but I was nowhere near Weapons/Security.\n\nAlice could be a self-report possibility, but based on opportunity, I\u2019m leaning Frank here."}}
{"timestamp": 1779402696.834458, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "I want to add: I did not see anyone coming out of Weapons when I went in \u2014 I just found Charlie\u2019s body there and hit report.\n\nDiana\u2019s story matches mine exactly for Electrical around tick 5. Frank also matches that I saw him in Security around tick 7, but that actually puts him coming from the direction of Weapons right after he says he was alone with Charlie there. Eve is unvouched, but Frank is the last person with Charlie alive in the room Charlie died in.\n\nI\u2019m leaning Frank unless someone has a stronger explanation for Bob\u2019s death too."}}
{"timestamp": 1779402720.4880042, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "I\u2019m still leaning Frank here. My own info is: I saw Bob and Charlie alive together in Security at tick 3, then I went Electrical and saw Alice at tick 5, then Medbay.\n\nAlice and my stories match independently, and Alice also saw Frank in Security around tick 7 \u2014 which fits Frank coming down from Weapons after being with Charlie. Charlie\u2019s body being found in Weapons makes Frank the clearest opportunity. Eve is unvouched, but she\u2019d have to be lying completely about being nowhere near the area, while Frank admits being in the exact kill room with the victim shortly before the report.\n\nBob\u2019s death is still unexplained, but for Charlie specifically, Frank is the strongest suspect. I think we should vote Frank."}}
{"timestamp": 1779402739.998544, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "Listen to yourselves for a second \u2014 if I were the Duck, why on earth would I openly admit to being in Weapons with Charlie right before the report? I would have just lied about my route! I told the truth because I\u2019m a Goose doing my tasks and I have nothing to hide. \n\nAlice found the body completely alone and is now using my honesty to frame me. That is a textbook self-report. She knew I just left the room, killed him, and reported it to pin it on me. \n\nAnd don't forget about Bob! Eve is completely unaccounted for this entire round. She claims she was in the lower map (Storage to Lower Engine) with zero witnesses. Bob could have easily been killed by Eve down there while Alice killed Charlie up top. \n\nI'm voting Eve because she has absolutely zero alibi for the entire game, but Alice is equally suspicious for this setup. Please don't let them play you \u2014 if you vote me out, the game is probably over."}}
{"timestamp": 1779402765.546714, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "Frank, your defense doesn\u2019t add up. There\u2019s only one Duck, so saying \u201cAlice killed Charlie and Eve killed Bob\u201d is impossible unless you\u2019re accusing two Ducks in a one-Duck game.\n\nMy route was Storage -> Lower Engine. I saw nobody, so yes, I\u2019m unvouched, but I was nowhere near Weapons. You admitted you were in Weapons with Charlie alive, then Alice saw you in Security coming from that direction, then Charlie\u2019s body was found in Weapons. That\u2019s the strongest opportunity we have.\n\nI still think the vote should be Frank."}}
